  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/02/IMG_2036.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>El alumnado de 3&ordm; de Infantil del colegio Mestre Caballero de Onda ha visitado la tarde de este mi&eacute;rcoles LLuna Estilistes, en la avenida de Catalunya, donde Ana Catal&aacute;n Gui&ntilde;&oacute;n les ha explicado la profesi&oacute;n de peluquer&iacute;a y est&eacute;tica.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/3erinfantilmestrecaballerollunaestilistes/img_2014.jpg\" alt=\"img_2014\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/3erinfantilmestrecaballerollunaestilistes/img_2015.jpg\" alt=\"img_2015\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/3erinfantilmestrecaballerollunaestilistes/img_2016.jpg\" alt=\"img_2016\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/3erinfantilmestrecaballerollunaestilistes/img_2017.jpg\" alt=\"img_2017\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/3erinfantilmestrecaballerollunaestilistes/img_2018.jpg\" alt=\"img_2018\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/3erinfantilmestrecaballerollunaestilistes/img_2020.jpg\" alt=\"img_2020\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/3erinfantilmestrecaballerollunaestilistes/img_2021.jpg\" alt=\"img_2021\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/3erinfantilmestrecaballerollunaestilistes/img_2022.jpg\" alt=\"img_2022\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d